      "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
